719 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 77 0 R/T(For the six-tuple sample, the original SUPPLY has 6 rows. The projections contain 6, 4 and 6 rows respectively, totalling 16 stored pair rows before considering index overhead. Joining all three projections under the valid JD reconstructs 6 triples. 5NF \(project-join normal form\) requires every non-trivial join dependency to be implied by candidate keys. It is rarely enforced because extra tables and joins increase implementation and query complexity. It is useful when a genuine cyclic rule makes the ternary relation exactly reconstructible from all three pairwise facts. )/E(For the six-tuple sample, the original SUPPLY has 6 rows. The projections contain 6, 4 and 6 rows respectively, totalling 16 stored pair rows before considering index overhead. Joining all three projections under the valid JD reconstructs 6 triples. 5NF \(project-join normal form\) requires every non-trivial join dependency to be implied by candidate keys. It is rarely enforced because extra tables and joins increase implementation and query complexity. It is useful when a genuine cyclic rule makes the ternary relation exactly reconstructible from all three pairwise facts. )/Pg 21 0 R/K[27]>>
