<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 84 0 R/T(The design preserves customer, product, supplier and order integrity and reduces update anomalies. Its cost is additional joins, indexes and maintenance. At 20,000 new lines per day, normalized inserts are manageable with batch loading and appropriate indexes. As orders grow, partitioning or archival may be considered after measuring workload. The recommendation balances data integrity with query performance; denormalization should be selective and supported by measured need. )/E(The design preserves customer, product, supplier and order integrity and reduces update anomalies. Its cost is additional joins, indexes and maintenance. At 20,000 new lines per day, normalized inserts are manageable with batch loading and appropriate indexes. As orders grow, partitioning or archival may be considered after measuring workload. The recommendation balances data integrity with query performance; denormalization should be selective and supported by measured need. )/Pg 28 0 R/K[19]>>
