1289 0 obj
<</Title(The original flat ORDER_LINE relation combines order, customer, product, supplier, category, warehouse, address and independent multivalued facts. Its functional and multivalued dependencies explain the resulting redundancy and anomalies. Decomposition through 2NF, 3NF, BCNF and 4NF separates facts according to their determinants; the conditional 5NF decomposition handles the cyclic SUPPLY join dependency. Under the revised requirement, the design should be modified by storing the exact price paid on each order line and adding workload-appropriate indexes. Actual performance claims must be completed using the reproducible experiments in Tasks 8\20510.)/Dest[30 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1231 0 R>>
endobj

