<</Title(A relation is in BCNF when every non-trivial FD determinant is a superkey. The relations above are BCNF under the stated dependencies, provided the address rule is represented carefully. In ADDRESS, AddressID is the key and \(ShipStreet, ShipCity\) is also a candidate key because it determines ShipPIN and AddressID identifies the address. Add UNIQUE\(ShipStreet, ShipCity\). In POSTAL, ShipPIN is the key. All remaining determinants are keys.)/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1757 0 R/First 1771 0 R/Last 1771 0 R/Count -1/Next 1772 0 R>>
