<</Title(For the six-tuple sample, the original SUPPLY has 6 rows. The projections contain 6, 4 and 6 rows respectively, totalling 16 stored pair rows before considering index overhead. Joining all three projections under the valid JD reconstructs 6 triples. 5NF \(project-join normal form\) requires every non-trivial join dependency to be implied by candidate keys. It is rarely enforced because extra tables and joins increase implementation and query complexity. It is useful when a genuine cyclic rule makes the ternary relation exactly reconstructible from all three pairwise facts.)/Dest[21 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1861 0 R/Prev 1876 0 R>>
endobj

